ay:inline-block;\">10%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"0.0000\" title=\"Earth\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Earth <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Poisoned Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Poisoned_Icon_Big_f04eb1.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 0 1px 1px; width:0.0000%; background-color:#ff3333; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; left:calc(5px + 100% * 0.0000); display:inline-block;\">0%</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Drown\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Drown <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Drowning Icon Big\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Drowning_Icon_Big_f65e47.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%?</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"creature-resistance-el\" data-value=\"1.0000\" title=\"Healing\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-label\">Healing <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Healing Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"16\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"16\"/></span></span></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar1\"><div class=\"creature-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:86.9565%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 13.0435%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Forbidden%20Lands\">Forbidden Lands</a>, on top of a hill in the northern part of the <a href=\"#/wiki/Arena%20and%20Zoo%20Quarter\">Arena and Zoo Quarter</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lower%20Spike\">Lower Spike</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Truffels%20Garden\">Truffels Garden</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mushroom%20Gardens\">Mushroom Gardens</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA massive earth elemental attacks in melee range. A massive earth elemental never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-strategy\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Strategy\">Strategy</span></h3>\n<p> <b>Mages:</b> <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Level</a> 50-: Use <a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a> while running or have knight as a blocker. <a href=\"#/wiki/Level\">Level</a> 60+: Just stand still and use <a href=\"#/wiki/Flame%20Strike\">Flame Strike</a> while healing when necessary. <br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Knight\">Knights</a></b> must stand in diagonal to avoid beam and attack as normal. The best option is to use fire-enchanted weapons or using any form of scorch on your weapon as you will kill it a lot faster.<br/>\n<b><a href=\"#/wiki/Paladin\">Paladins</a></b> should use their regular <a href=\"#/wiki/Spear\">Spears</a> and heal when needed, also <a href=\"#/wiki/Great%20Fireball\">GFB runes</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Fire%20Bomb\">fire bombs</a> if you get swarmed.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Was as strong as a <a href=\"#/wiki/Behemoth\">Behemoth</a> before Winter Update 2008. After the Update of 8.4 their Melee attack got weaker and they use less special attacks.</li>\n<li>As announced on May 14, 2024, the patch increased experience from 950 to 1,100, and increased ice sensitivity from 0% to 85% as part of the 2024 Balancing Project.</li>\n<li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"semi-rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Might%20Ring\">Might Ring</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 1,187 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\"><img alt=\"Gold Coin\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Coin_a5b511.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></span></span></td>\n<td><a href=\"#/wiki/Gold%20Coin\">Gold Coin</a></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1-240</td>\n<td>63.6</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"93.513058\" style=\"text-align:center;\">94%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelements-container\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Lump of Earth\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Lump_of_Earth_e285c7.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span></span></span></td>\n<td>Lump of Earth</td>\n<td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Check Mark\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Check_Mark_b3619b.gif\" width=\"12\"